Package: zephyr-docker
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, rsync, make, docker.io | docker-ce, bash
Recommends: bash-completion
Description: Docker image template and mkdockerimage helper for Node apps
 zephyr-docker provides a reusable Docker build/runtime template for
 applications shaped like zephyr (backend + web + prisma), plus the
 mkdockerimage(1) tool that materializes the template into an app repo
 and builds the image.
 .
 Placeholders (zephyr, 990/991) are replaced with the application name
 and ports derived from backend PORT. Optional modules cover Playwright
 e2e and mobile www.
 .
 Install bash-completion for programmable completion of mkdockerimage(1).
